  2227	      /*
  2228	       * Mirror the clean ESP-IDF reference driver's
  2229	       * auto_clear_after_cb=true behavior.
  2230	       *
  2231	       * This lower-half uses an immutable cyclic DMA descriptor ring whose
  2232	       * private payload buffer stays attached to the descriptor.  Once a slot
  2233	       * has completed, clear that private payload BEFORE publishing the upper
  2234	       * callback.  If the producer is late refilling the slot, the next ring
  2235	       * wrap therefore emits digital zero instead of replaying stale PCM.
  2236	       *
