 586	 * and I2S DMA continue independently; waiting for each DMA callback here
 587	 * starves adevsink of APBs and makes it report a false xrun after four
 588	 * buffers.  Use one absolute timeline so scheduler delay does not accumulate
 589	 * into audible gaps. */
