    73	/****************************************************************************
    74	 * Weak playback backend
    75	 *
    76	 * robot_audio_playback.c is contest-local application code and is already
    77	 * linked by robot_voice.  Weak declarations keep board bring-up independent:
    78	 * if that application is not present, the audio device still registers, but
    79	 * START/ENQUEUE return -ENOSYS instead of dereferencing a missing symbol.
    80	 ****************************************************************************/
